00:00:55.160 --> 00:00:56.920
What is cloud cost management?

00:00:56.920 --> 00:01:00.830
Fundamentally, it's about
controlling-- or monitoring,

00:01:00.830 --> 00:01:05.000
controlling, allocating,
and optimizing your cost.

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:09.070
So cloud promises accelerated
innovation and reduced cost.

00:01:09.070 --> 00:01:11.860
But in reality,
that cost savings

00:01:11.860 --> 00:01:13.660
are not always realized.

00:01:13.660 --> 00:01:15.580
And another big
impact, a big change

00:01:15.580 --> 00:01:19.060
